# Haruka Scene v6
# Physics joints and events check (2026-11-20, Docs/Physics_Joints_And_Events.md J5). Press Play:
# Gate is a plank hinged to GatePost along Z with limits -60..0 degrees; gravity swings it down until it stops at -60.
# Chain is four balls joined by distance joints, hanging from ChainAnchor. DropBox falls into TriggerZone (a static trigger)
# and stays inside, so the zone reports one enter and no exit. The physics_joints test loads this scene and checks the poses.
